{
  "_about": [
    "The eidolon evolutions of the Advanced Player's Guide's summoner, as the anatomy",
    "catalogue a race is built from on the Races bench: 'they can craft the anatomy from",
    "the Eidolon evolutions free of cost' (2026-09-06). `points` is the summoner's own",
    "cost, kept for the record; a race pays nothing for an evolution, so rules/races.py",
    "prices none of them. Each evolution says what it grants in the race grammar — tags",
    "the sheet asks through has_state, modifiers through the one funnel, natural weapons",
    "the sheet can put in a hand, speeds — and `not_yet` names what the engine has no",
    "reader for, said rather than dropped. `$choice` is filled from the picker: an energy,",
    "a skill, an ability, a limb kind. `takes` is how many times it may be chosen."
  ],
